  "body": [
    "Introducing a fresh take on protection for your shipments",
    "Log In",
    "Get a Quote",
    "Contact Us",
    "United States - English United States - English Estados Unidos - Español Select Another Country or Territory",
    "United States - English",
    "Shipping Insurance Shipping Insurance Multi-Carrier Shipments UPS Shipments Special Commodities Select My Coverage Get a Quote",
    "Solutions Solutions CommerceShield DeliveryDefense Delivery Orchestration InsureShield® Shipping Insurance",
    "Claims",
    "Partners Partners Connect with a Partner Become a Partner",
    "Resources Resources Insights Whitepapers & Guides Customer Stories Help & Support The Logistics Lowdown",
    "About About Announcements In The News Product Availability Contact Us",
    "Solutions",
    "Delivery Orchestration",
    "Delivery",
    "Say goodbye to delivery inefficiencies and hello to a smarter, more automated way of managing shipments.",
    "Our delivery orchestration platform optimizes logistics, streamlines automation, and enhances dispatch reliability - all in one intuitive solution.",
    "Same-Day & Next-Day Delivery",
    "Stay ahead of customer expectations with lightning-fast delivery solutions that integrate seamlessly into your omnichannel strategy. Whether online or in-store, deliver with confidence and efficiency.",
    "Shipping Made Simple",
    "Our powerful, centralized integration platform connects directly with shipping carriers and third-party multi-carrier engines - giving your business the competitive edge to optimize costs, increase speed, and improve customer satisfaction.",
    "Effortless Delivery Management",
    "Take control of your last-mile logistics with advanced features like customizable parameters and rules for drivers and vehicles that ensure timely, hassle-free deliveries every time.",
    "100+",
    "Operating Providers",
    "23K",
    "Stores Served",
    "99.8%",
    "Order Success Rate",
    "Intelligent Orchestration",
    "Create a customized dispatch strategy with dynamic rule-based automation for batching, carrier selection, and scheduling. Optimize based on factors live delivery network coverage, cost efficiency, speed, and other key attributes.",
    "Flexible Order Batching",
    "Batching enhances control over dispatch operations, delivery service provider (DSP) selection, and overall order management. Orders within a batch can be automatically processed and prioritized based on various criteria for optimized efficiency.",
    "Pickup Locations",
    "Customize pickup locations for DSPs to align with your business needs and operational flow. Choose from storefronts, warehouses, or distribution centers (DCs) to optimize fulfillment efficiency.",
    "Custom Coverage",
    "Retailers can define precise delivery zones by setting a coverage radius, customizing service areas within polygons or zip codes, and restricting specific regions from eligibility as needed.",
    "Delivery Assurance",
    "Verify delivery availability before finalizing an order. Retail teams can assess and confirm eligible delivery options for both in-store and online purchases.",
    "Analytics & Insights",
    "Bulit-in reports provide instant business insights with no setup required. Advanced models, continuously refined using historical delivery data, offer accurate ETA and ETD predictions across the platform. Reports can also be easily exported to BI tools or Excel for deeper analysis.",
    "We offer multimodel, multicarrier shipping coverage options, so you can rest easy knowing your bottom line is fully covered. Explore our options below, or ask a team member to review your options with you.",
    "*Expedited reshipping reimbursement provided up to 20% of the insured value of the goods.",
    "Insurance coverage is underwritten by an authorized insurance company and issued through licensed insurance producers, including UPS Capital Insurance Agency, Inc. (“UPSCIA”), a subsidiary of UPS Capital Corporation. The insurance company, UPSCIA and its licensed affiliates reserve the right to change or cancel the program at any time. This information does not in any way alter or amend the terms, limitations or exclusions of the applicable insurance policy or program. Insurance coverage is not available in all jurisdictions.",
    "Unless otherwise noted, all statistics used herein are derived from or based on information contained in the 2023 Platform Research, which is based on a compilation of two independent studies conducted by Evalueserve in December 2023 of 1,245 U.S. SMB owners and decision makers whose businesses report $250K - $100M in revenue.",
    "Statistics in our social media advertising are based on aggregated insurance product data collected by UPS Capital Insurance Agency, Inc. during the period of four consecutive fiscal quarters ending the prior calendar year. Individual results may vary.",
